          "id": "demo-assistant-01",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "## A workspace that remembers and gets things done\n\nKeep the conversation simple, and give each kind of information a clear home.\n\n| Area | Use it for | What you keep |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Chat & voice** | Ask questions and work through a task | Conversation context |\n| **Tools & workflows** | Search, convert files, and automate a routine | Results and artifacts |\n| **Memory** | Save preferences and useful facts | Searchable long-term context |\n| **Canvas** | Turn research into something worth keeping | Notes, briefs, and original sources |\n\n**A practical starting point:** search your saved sources, compare the options, and keep the finished brief in Canvas. Add integrations as you need them.",
